# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Both GenLayer networks are registered at
# once - the network switcher in the app sidebar picks between them at
# runtime (see src/lib/network.ts) - so both contract addresses are needed,
# not just one.
#
# Asimov Testnet  - chain id 4221,  RPC https://rpc-asimov.genlayer.com
# Studio Network  - chain id 61999, RPC https://studio.genlayer.com/api (gasless)

VITE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS_ASIMOV=
VITE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS_STUDIONET=
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
